1
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:26,860
Aiming for a certain day
floating on the Nakagawa,

2
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:34,000
I kicked a pebble,
and even my shoe flew off.

3
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:42,180
Onto the head of the gym
teacher who was chopping it

4
00:00:42,570 --> 00:00:48,440
They laughed at me for
still acting like a kid.

5
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:55,280
Even if I stir up some energy somewhere,
Katsushika is no use.

6
00:00:55,280 --> 00:01:02,540
With one yawn, the unchanging
streetscape is strangely gentle.

7
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:14,300
From the pointed hat's water canteen,
interpretation of the heavens.

8
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:16,800
The evening sun sets.

9
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:25,240
Tomorrow will end like this too

10
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:30,360
Katsushika, Shibamata,
even happiness is lost again.

11
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:33,840
Because I'm a fool who finally realized it.

12
00:01:52,860 --> 00:01:53,580
Ippon!

13
00:01:56,420 --> 00:01:58,420
Yes! That's the one!

14
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:02,540
Alright! With overwhelming strength,
he's through to the final.

15
00:02:02,540 --> 00:02:05,640
Well, that's his true self.

16
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,500
Lately, whenever you mention Sagonji,

17
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:08,880
Sagonji!

18
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,740
the image has completely taken hold,

19
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:15,240
but he's a brawler.

20
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:17,560
Now, who's his opponent in the final?

21
00:02:19,180 --> 00:02:21,180
Volvo-san is doing his best too, isn't he?

22
00:02:21,180 --> 00:02:24,620
He only started judo
seriously not long ago, right?

23
00:02:25,380 --> 00:02:26,900
His improvement is incredible.

24
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:28,760
Time's up.

25
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:31,520
That's it. Red wins by superior points.

26
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,500
Yay, he won!

27
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:36,380
Sakonji versus Volvo

28
00:02:36,380 --> 00:02:38,740
This is going to be an exciting match.

29
00:02:38,740 --> 00:02:39,440
Senpai.

30
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:39,800
Yeah.

31
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:43,060
But in other martial arts, who knows,

32
00:02:44,480 --> 00:02:46,240
but this one's going to be
a landslide win for Sakonji.

33
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:48,020
His experience is on a whole other level.

34
00:02:48,620 --> 00:02:50,900
You never know until you actually fight.

35
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,100
That's right.

36
00:02:52,100 --> 00:02:53,860
Sometimes it comes down to luck, too.

37
00:02:53,860 --> 00:02:56,200
Sakonji throws anyone,

38
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:58,280
even women and children,
with everything he's got.

39
00:02:58,660 --> 00:02:59,260
No way, no way.

40
00:03:00,300 --> 00:03:02,260
Red corner: Sakonji, Tatsunosuke-kun.

41
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:05,300
White corner: Volvo, Saigo-kun.

42
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:06,620
Bow.

43
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,520
You made it all the way here, Volvo.

44
00:03:10,900 --> 00:03:13,320
I'll fight you with everything I have,
Sakonji.

45
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:14,880
Hajime!

46
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:21,760
Let's go!

47
00:03:24,940 --> 00:03:25,820
Osu!

48
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:31,920
You've improved, Volvo.
But you've still got a long way to go.

49
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:35,280
I'm going to finish this with an ippon!

50
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:45,320
GO! GO! BOBBY! GO! GO!
GO! GO! BOBBY! GO! GO!

51
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:48,720
What? J-Jody, do you know him?

52
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:52,100
Y-yeah, Jody is Volvo's girlfriend!

53
00:03:52,320 --> 00:03:53,260
What?!

54
00:03:54,220 --> 00:03:56,420
Y-yeah, the truth is,

55
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:59,720
I believed you were the only true fighter!

56
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:05,420
Look how strong I've become
after all that training!

57
00:04:06,260 --> 00:04:08,600
GO! GO! BOBBY! GO! GO!

58
00:04:41,300 --> 00:04:45,920
So you passed out with a nosebleed after
seeing Jody in her cheerleader outfit

59
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,680
Pervert!

60
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,040
No, it's not like that.

61
00:05:05,380 --> 00:05:07,300
Look at him go, Sakonji!

62
00:05:07,300 --> 00:05:10,940
After all,
word about the nosebleed has gotten around.

63
00:05:10,940 --> 00:05:12,940
I never admitted it was a nosebleed.

64
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:18,080
Sorry, it's my fault.

65
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:19,420
Not at all.

66
00:05:20,580 --> 00:05:22,380
Hey, there's Bobby!

67
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:26,440
Hey Bobby, nap time!

68
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:28,760
George, what's with that outfit?

69
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:30,920
You came all the way to Japan,

70
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:33,880
so I thought you'd get
some serious judo training.

71
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:36,260
The master of this dojo is

72
00:05:37,300 --> 00:05:37,760
that guy.

73
00:05:38,340 --> 00:05:41,480
You're the guy who lost to Bobby and got a nosebleed,
aren't you?

74
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,300
Hey!

75
00:05:42,300 --> 00:05:42,780
Yah!

76
00:05:42,780 --> 00:05:45,720
Sakonji,
Jody didn't mean any harm by it, you know.

77
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:46,940
I-I know.

78
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,640
Come on, bring it!

79
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,860
Here I come!

80
00:05:58,780 --> 00:06:01,440
You seem to have some skill,
but you're still green.

81
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:03,820
Just don't get a nosebleed again, okay?

82
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:10,460
No matter who my opponent is,
I won't get a nosebleed.

83
00:06:18,780 --> 00:06:19,920
Are you all right, Jody?

84
00:06:24,340 --> 00:06:25,420
It's my first time.

85
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:30,020
This music... could it be?

86
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:41,860
I saw it! I saw it! I saw it!

87
00:06:43,420 --> 00:06:44,180
Papa

88
00:06:44,180 --> 00:06:45,940
So it really is Colonel Bakuryu?

89
00:06:45,940 --> 00:06:47,760
Didn't Colonel Bakuryu...

90
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:50,040
the man who defeated Jody back then...

91
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:52,360
Didn't you say it would be declared void?

92
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:02,760
Don't overdo it.

93
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:05,900
Bobby.

94
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:08,620
Jody, what on earth happened?

95
00:07:08,620 --> 00:07:11,920
This man is hereby officially
designated as Jody's Hanako.

96
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:14,120
Let's start the wedding
preparations right away.

97
00:07:16,860 --> 00:07:17,680
Jody.

98
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,780
Bobby.

99
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,340
Jody.

100
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,220
Good grief.

101
00:07:29,700 --> 00:07:30,660
Jody.

102
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:33,760
Don't worry so much.

103
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:37,000
Understood, senpai.

104
00:07:37,700 --> 00:07:41,860
The two of them have apparently been
taken to an army base in New Mexico.

105
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:46,200
This is

106
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:49,060
a wedding venue under construction,
isn't it?

107
00:07:49,780 --> 00:07:51,762
Colonel Bakuryu is having it built

108
00:07:51,812 --> 00:07:54,860
inside the base just for the couple's wedding,
it seems.

109
00:07:55,860 --> 00:07:57,560
Is that old man serious?

110
00:07:57,820 --> 00:08:00,360
Ryotsu, please, do something about it.

111
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:03,728
I know. A reckless wedding like this

112
00:08:03,778 --> 00:08:05,720
won't do anyone any good.

113
00:08:06,260 --> 00:08:08,380
I'll crush this wedding.

114
00:08:20,580 --> 00:08:21,540
Right, take it.

115
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:32,180
Sure thing.

116
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,820
I see, so that's how they plan to get in.

117
00:08:36,820 --> 00:08:39,980
Building materials have to be brought in from outside,
after all.

118
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:56,160
It's on the second floor, right?

119
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:58,600
That window over there is Jody's room.

120
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,220
I see.

121
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:09,040
She's really in that room, isn't she?

122
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,480
There's no mistake.

123
00:09:14,620 --> 00:09:16,780
Shut up! They wouldn't do that, would they!

124
00:09:16,980 --> 00:09:17,500
Jody!

125
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:19,920
Bobby.

126
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:20,900
Is that Bobby?

127
00:09:21,700 --> 00:09:22,880
What are you doing here?

128
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:24,740
I've come to take you back.

129
00:09:25,260 --> 00:09:25,840
Me?

130
00:09:26,420 --> 00:09:27,200
No way.

131
00:09:27,740 --> 00:09:29,600
Papa won't allow it.

132
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:32,820
Are you really going to
marry Sakonji like this?

133
00:09:33,340 --> 00:09:35,060
It's your fault, Bobby.

134
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:38,740
If only you had pinned me sooner.

135
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:40,000
Guardy

136
00:09:40,380 --> 00:09:41,780
What was that noise just now?

137
00:09:44,100 --> 00:09:45,120
It's Papa.

138
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:47,240
If we're caught, we're in serious trouble.

139
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:48,320
Run!

140
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,200
But...

141
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:49,960
Hurry!

142
00:09:50,420 --> 00:09:51,300
It's all right, don't worry.

143
00:09:58,340 --> 00:10:00,360
Good night, Master.

144
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,600
Good night.

145
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:04,780
You guys.

146
00:10:04,780 --> 00:10:06,840
We came to rescue you.

147
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:08,240
I see.

148
00:10:13,940 --> 00:10:15,960
This is no time to be taking it easy!

149
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:18,940
Let's head back to Katsushika.

150
00:10:22,420 --> 00:10:27,680
What? You were forced to come here,
weren't you?

151
00:10:28,180 --> 00:10:34,100
Sure, being brought here was forceful,
but I only realized it after coming here.

152
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:41,840
This is where I truly belong. Right now,
I'm teaching judo to the soldiers here.

153
00:10:43,040 --> 00:10:46,620
Everyone calls me Master and respects me.

154
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:50,460
Even in private,
they're all good-natured guys.

155
00:10:50,460 --> 00:10:55,160
Yo, what do they call me
now at Katsushika Station?

156
00:10:55,160 --> 00:10:57,460
Sakonji of Hanaji Keio.

157
00:10:57,460 --> 00:11:02,040
Right, me, the judo master,
I'm Sakonji of Hanaji Keio!

158
00:11:02,660 --> 00:11:07,680
As long as you live in Katsushika, that Hanaji Keio
label will follow you for the rest of your life!

159
00:11:08,180 --> 00:11:09,120
Well, who knows.

160
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,980
I've made up my mind.

161
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:14,240
To wash away the tainted
image I had in Katsushika,

162
00:11:14,290 --> 00:11:16,740
I'm starting over from
scratch here in America!

163
00:11:17,580 --> 00:11:21,360
But to do that, I have to marry Jody!

164
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:24,600
You've always hated real women, haven't you!

165
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:27,863
No, well, the thing is, I realized recently,

166
00:11:27,913 --> 00:11:30,920
doesn't Jody look a bit
like Saori from Dokimemo?

167
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:32,280
Where?!

168
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:35,391
So I'll do the hairstyle like this,

169
00:11:35,441 --> 00:11:38,980
the eyes like this, the nose like so,
and the mouth like this.

170
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:43,760
Then I shape the outline like this,
and finally adjust the skin tone like so,

171
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:46,060
see? It's Saori herself, isn't it?

172
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:49,120
Ryo, this is a miracle!

173
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:51,360
You just swapped everything around,
that's all!

174
00:11:52,100 --> 00:11:54,340
You've forgotten the most important thing.

175
00:11:54,340 --> 00:11:57,380
You can't play Dokimemo
while you're in America.

176
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:00,560
Besides, Jody is the jealous type.

177
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:03,740
Even if she's just a game character,
I won't stand for any cheating!

178
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:05,580
I'm prepared for that.

179
00:12:06,040 --> 00:12:07,960
Starting today, I'm forgetting about Saori.

180
00:12:08,980 --> 00:12:11,080
Jody is my Saori now!

181
00:12:11,900 --> 00:12:14,040
Jody...

182
00:12:15,040 --> 00:12:17,520
What is this guy going on about?

183
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:41,300
I should've lost that match.

184
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:43,960
I never thought it would come to this.

185
00:12:44,540 --> 00:12:46,940
Those two don't seem to want to come back.

186
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:54,920
There's nothing we can do, senpai. You're so naive.
Do you really think Sakonji can forget Saori that easily?

187
00:12:55,360 --> 00:13:00,400
Do you have some kind of plan? Let me guess, it's the
"Saori Project"?

188
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:09,980
Alright, that's it for today.

189
00:13:10,680 --> 00:13:11,040
Thank you very much.

190
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:16,360
This is...

191
00:13:16,740 --> 00:13:17,100
This is...

192
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:25,960
The pens that came with
the life-size Saori figure.

193
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:29,000
It's worth the collector's
price of fifteen thousand yen.

194
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:32,020
Never expected to run
into one of these here.

195
00:13:32,680 --> 00:13:34,520
Hey, Saori.

196
00:13:36,340 --> 00:13:38,540
Master, is something wrong?

197
00:13:38,900 --> 00:13:40,140
What are you talking about?

198
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:44,520
I thought I just heard the master screaming.

199
00:13:45,060 --> 00:13:46,380
You must have imagined it.

200
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:47,880
If you say so.

201
00:13:47,880 --> 00:13:50,860
If anything happens,
don't hesitate to tell us.

202
00:13:50,860 --> 00:13:55,060
The master has an important body to protect,
with his wedding to Jody coming up.

203
00:13:55,060 --> 00:13:57,340
If anything happens to the master,

204
00:13:57,340 --> 00:14:00,100
Colonel Bakuryu will scold us.

205
00:14:00,760 --> 00:14:02,040
I know.

206
00:14:02,640 --> 00:14:03,220
That's right.

207
00:14:03,220 --> 00:14:06,300
If someone saw me clutching Saori,

208
00:14:06,300 --> 00:14:08,400
my wedding would be ruined.

209
00:14:09,300 --> 00:14:10,760
Really, it's fine.

210
00:14:10,760 --> 00:14:13,680
You two go clean the dojo.

211
00:14:14,380 --> 00:14:14,740
Yes.

212
00:14:16,400 --> 00:14:19,420
I've decided to forget about Saori.

213
00:14:19,420 --> 00:14:20,820
Farewell, Saori.

214
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:28,200
Come on, Ryo-tsu... you can't do that.

215
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:31,240
Not yet, the operation has only just begun.

216
00:14:42,100 --> 00:14:46,060
This is the product a certain soap maker, somehow
mistaking what to do, released as a children's item,

217
00:14:46,060 --> 00:14:49,980
the phantom Dokimemo Shop that
was recalled within just one week.

218
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:52,700
Hey, Saorii.

219
00:14:57,100 --> 00:14:59,360
It's nothing, really, nothing at all.

220
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:02,340
Master, your body is precious,
since you're about to get married.

221
00:15:02,340 --> 00:15:05,660
I know, I know,
so just let me take my shower in peace.

222
00:15:06,680 --> 00:15:07,400
Y-yes.

223
00:15:09,820 --> 00:15:12,120
Sorry, Saori, please forgive me.

224
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:20,900
Master, are you feeling unwell somewhere?

225
00:15:21,380 --> 00:15:22,600
No, it's nothing.

226
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:26,600
Damn it, Saori goods I can't
get my hands on at Pitta!

227
00:15:30,940 --> 00:15:32,860
Good night, Master.

228
00:15:32,860 --> 00:15:34,540
Good night.

229
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,880
What's going on, Master?

230
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,240
It's nothing.

231
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:46,180
But that scream just now -

232
00:15:46,180 --> 00:15:48,780
I said it's nothing, so it's nothing!

233
00:15:52,940 --> 00:15:53,660
Hey...

234
00:15:53,660 --> 00:15:59,020
Aaagh!

235
00:16:00,540 --> 00:16:01,260
Hey...

236
00:16:05,620 --> 00:16:06,540
I can't believe...

237
00:16:06,540 --> 00:16:14,180
The in-store display from when Dokimemo first came out,
the one made to triple sales!

238
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:20,200
Among collectors it's a legendary item worth over 100,000 yen,
that one, that one!

239
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:27,020
Why are you here? I see, Ryotsu, you're
trying to sabotage my wedding, aren't you?

240
00:16:27,540 --> 00:16:32,620
Don't give me that innocent smile.
I can't just let you stay here.

241
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:45,040
Saori~

242
00:16:45,040 --> 00:16:47,440
Saori~

243
00:16:47,550 --> 00:16:49,480
Saori~

244
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:53,260
Saori~

245
00:16:53,260 --> 00:16:57,040
Rehoi

246
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:10,480
Saori...
I have to go through this painful feeling

247
00:17:16,100 --> 00:17:17,540
Guess I'll watch some TV.

248
00:17:19,700 --> 00:17:20,640
*Pachan!*

249
00:17:22,380 --> 00:17:23,500
Saori~

250
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:28,280
Forget about Saori!
Sakonji, you're... over her.

251
00:17:28,600 --> 00:17:30,580
I'm taking a new step forward here.

252
00:17:30,580 --> 00:17:32,480
I have to forget about Saori now.

253
00:17:42,420 --> 00:17:43,060
Hello?

254
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:45,920
How cruel, Sa-chan,
switching off the TV all of a sudden!

255
00:17:45,920 --> 00:17:46,780
Saori~

256
00:17:46,780 --> 00:17:49,540
Fine, I'm standing you
up for tomorrow's date!

257
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:51,720
No, that thing just now...

258
00:17:52,500 --> 00:17:55,900
This is Ryotsu's doing. Isn't that obvious?

259
00:17:55,900 --> 00:18:00,180
I bought a new swimsuit for tomorrow's date,
one that shows a little of my belly button.

260
00:18:00,180 --> 00:18:01,860
The kind that shows your belly button.

261
00:18:07,340 --> 00:18:24,940
Uuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuu...

262
00:18:24,940 --> 00:18:25,700
Jody!

263
00:18:26,300 --> 00:18:27,960
There must still be some way.

264
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:29,280
Still, something...

265
00:18:34,760 --> 00:18:38,720
Looks like we can hold the wedding tomorrow as planned,
after all.

266
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:39,480
Y-yeah!

267
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:42,300
Is something bothering you?

268
00:18:42,300 --> 00:18:43,020
N-no...

269
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,300
Nothing has happened since then.

270
00:18:45,300 --> 00:18:47,020
If anything, it's eerie.

271
00:18:52,700 --> 00:18:55,100
Is the wedding dress finished too?

272
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:56,840
Papa, Tatsunosuke.

273
00:18:57,320 --> 00:18:59,880
He's playing his part, Jody.

274
00:18:59,880 --> 00:19:04,060
I'm a lucky man to be
marrying such a beauty.

275
00:19:05,980 --> 00:19:07,700
This is good, this is good.

276
00:19:10,900 --> 00:19:11,860
Saoriii!

277
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:15,280
Bobby!

278
00:19:20,780 --> 00:19:22,560
Since when did we have
that game in the rec room?

279
00:19:23,380 --> 00:19:25,580
I haven't played a game in a while.

280
00:19:27,140 --> 00:19:28,140
A new model?

281
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:30,980
Fight!

282
00:19:31,080 --> 00:19:32,600
Dee!

283
00:19:33,600 --> 00:19:34,260
No, no, no, no, no.

284
00:19:34,260 --> 00:19:38,620
Yay!

285
00:19:40,800 --> 00:19:42,340
W-what was that just now?!

286
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:47,220
Why is it asking to continue when we won?

287
00:19:47,460 --> 00:19:47,980
Damn it!

288
00:19:48,420 --> 00:19:49,720
Something's bugging me...

289
00:19:51,600 --> 00:19:52,000
Hey!

290
00:19:56,960 --> 00:19:58,180
Yes!

291
00:19:59,120 --> 00:20:00,360
Alright, this time for sure!

292
00:20:01,680 --> 00:20:02,460
It appeared!

293
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:04,940
Turn this way, come on.

294
00:20:06,540 --> 00:20:07,340
Yes, yes, yes.

295
00:20:10,940 --> 00:20:12,580
We were so close.

296
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:17,020
I won't lose to some monster!

297
00:20:19,260 --> 00:20:20,320
We did it!

298
00:20:21,760 --> 00:20:24,000
Hurry, that girl from before -

299
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:27,700
If I win this time, I'll -

300
00:20:27,700 --> 00:20:29,560
with you...

301
00:20:29,560 --> 00:20:31,860
That's definitely Saori.

302
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:37,360
Well, if I win, what's gonna happen!

303
00:20:37,500 --> 00:20:39,160
Wait, wait, Saori!

304
00:20:40,780 --> 00:20:41,540
What's gonna happen!

305
00:20:44,140 --> 00:20:45,080
Gotcha!

306
00:20:45,780 --> 00:20:49,500
I had all my programmer
buddies work on it for a week.

307
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:51,960
A fighting-game-style dating sim.

308
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:53,520
It's Dokimemo Fight!

309
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:59,120
It's a terrifying game that gets you hooked
on Dokimemo without even realizing it.

310
00:20:59,120 --> 00:21:01,120
Yeah, I'm doing this, Saori!

311
00:21:01,140 --> 00:21:03,780
If I show this look to
Colonel Bakuryu and Jody,

312
00:21:03,780 --> 00:21:05,520
the wedding's off!

313
00:21:06,380 --> 00:21:07,840
Senpai, look.

314
00:21:08,960 --> 00:21:09,900
It's Colonel Bakuryu!

315
00:21:10,460 --> 00:21:12,700
Saves us the trouble of calling him.

316
00:21:15,260 --> 00:21:16,820
Then let's head home together.

317
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,440
Saori!

318
00:21:20,900 --> 00:21:23,160
Actually, I wanted to ask you something.

319
00:21:26,020 --> 00:21:28,280
Wait, wait, Saori!

320
00:21:29,900 --> 00:21:30,340
This is...

321
00:21:30,340 --> 00:21:30,940
This is...

322
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:33,480
Dad, Tatsunosuke.

323
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:38,720
I just can't forget about Bobby.

324
00:21:38,720 --> 00:21:41,540
I can't marry Tatsunosuke feeling like this.

325
00:21:41,540 --> 00:21:43,020
Talk it over with me again.

326
00:21:48,120 --> 00:21:49,520
I want to see the ocean.

327
00:21:49,520 --> 00:21:50,720
The ocean?

328
00:21:51,540 --> 00:21:53,600
Hey, Saoriii.

329
00:21:54,060 --> 00:21:55,680
Whoa, Saori!

330
00:21:56,140 --> 00:21:59,180
If we go to the ocean,
we can see Saori-chan in her swimsuit!

331
00:22:00,380 --> 00:22:02,160
Whoa! Run for it!

332
00:22:02,780 --> 00:22:03,480
What's the point?

333
00:22:03,740 --> 00:22:04,100
It is!

334
00:22:05,360 --> 00:22:08,660
Somebody come! Hurry!
Saori-chan is going to disappear!

335
00:22:14,520 --> 00:22:16,120
W-what is this?!

336
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:20,000
Dad, what are you doing?
What about the wedding preparations?

337
00:22:20,220 --> 00:22:21,880
Do that stuff on your own!

338
00:22:22,100 --> 00:22:22,960
Why is that?

339
00:22:23,440 --> 00:22:26,580
Tatsunosuke, which is more important to you,
that girl or me?

340
00:22:26,840 --> 00:22:28,400
Obviously Saori, of course!

341
00:22:31,520 --> 00:22:31,860
I see.

342
00:22:34,300 --> 00:22:35,960
What was that all about?

343
00:22:39,160 --> 00:22:40,740
Everyone go to hell!

344
00:22:47,760 --> 00:22:49,580
Where are you, Tatsunosuke?

345
00:22:52,900 --> 00:22:54,180
Do something, Volvo!

346
00:22:54,180 --> 00:22:56,340
Once it's like that, nobody can stop her.

347
00:23:00,480 --> 00:23:02,540
W-wait, stop, Jody!

348
00:23:02,540 --> 00:23:03,620
Hah.

349
00:23:10,420 --> 00:23:11,700
There you are.

350
00:23:14,860 --> 00:23:17,509
Payback for toying with a maiden's heart,

351
00:23:17,559 --> 00:23:19,220
you're going to take it.

352
00:23:33,340 --> 00:23:34,800
So that's how it ended up.

353
00:23:34,800 --> 00:23:38,460
Yeah, so Jody-san
prefers Volvo-san after all

354
00:23:39,080 --> 00:23:42,880
I'll just keep waiting for Bobby to defeat me,
like always.

355
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:43,080
Wa.

356
00:23:43,080 --> 00:23:44,860
As for Sakonji-san,

357
00:23:45,360 --> 00:23:49,860
he's hooked on Dokimemo again,
saying real women are too much work now.

358
00:23:49,860 --> 00:23:50,660
Doki doki.

359
00:23:54,080 --> 00:23:56,360
Tatch-chan, cheer up, okay?

360
00:23:56,360 --> 00:23:58,540
Hey, Saori.

361
00:24:26,360 --> 00:24:26,760
me

362
00:24:36,220 --> 00:24:37,620
me

363
00:24:39,960 --> 00:24:41,360
me

364
00:24:41,360 --> 00:24:41,700
me

365
00:24:41,700 --> 00:24:43,320
me

366
00:24:43,320 --> 00:24:45,120
me

367
00:24:46,360 --> 00:24:47,400
me

368
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:47,860
me

369
00:24:47,860 --> 00:24:58,320
It feels like we're melting together,
enough to make everyone a little jealous,

370
00:24:58,900 --> 00:25:07,960
I want to confess it, but for some reason,
only in love am I so timid.

371
00:25:09,020 --> 00:25:15,780
Don't hide everything
behind your bravado anymore.

372
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:23,540
I visited the elementary school
that was going to be torn down.

373
00:25:23,540 --> 00:25:24,740
We, Tonchinkan,

374
00:25:24,740 --> 00:25:28,460
met a girl there who looked just
like a classmate who should have died.

375
00:25:28,960 --> 00:25:30,900
The sound of the piano in that music room

376
00:25:30,900 --> 00:25:33,800
vividly brought our memories back to life.

377
00:25:34,340 --> 00:25:36,960
Next time, "Tōi Hōkago." See you then!

378
00:25:37,960 --> 00:25:41,740
Thank you for watching.

